    a partial invoice patch
[DTO] InvoiceDto: id, userId, contractId?, jobName?, description?, dueDate, customerId?, amount?, discountCents?, discountReason?, issuedDate?, status?, paidAt?, scheduledFor?, installmentIndex?, installmentTotal?, remindersMuted?, reminderHistory(s), paymentIntent?, urgency?, createdAt, updatedAt
    a persisted invoice record
[DTO] InvoiceListDto: invoice(s)
    a list of invoices owned by the user
[DTO] DiscountInvoiceDto: id, discountCents, reason?
    input to apply a discount to an invoice
[DTO] CreatePaymentDto: invoiceId, amount, method, receivedAt, reference?
    input to record a payment
[DTO] UpdatePaymentDto: amount?, method?, receivedAt?, reference?
    a partial payment patch
[DTO] PaymentDto: id, userId, invoiceId, amount, method, receivedAt, reference?, createdAt, updatedAt
    a persisted payment record
[DTO] PaymentListDto: payment(s)
    a list of payments
[DTO] CreatePaymentTermsDto: name, installment(s), description?
    input to create a payment-terms template
[DTO] UpdatePaymentTermsDto: name?, installment(s), description?
    a partial payment-terms patch
[DTO] PaymentTermsDto: id, userId, name, installment(s), description?, createdAt, updatedAt
    a persisted payment-terms template
[DTO] PaymentTermsListDto: plan(s)
    a list of payment-terms templates
[DTO] PaymentTermsCheckDto: id, totalPercent, isBalanced
    a percent-balance check for a terms template
[DTO] ResolveTermsDto: id, total?
    input to resolve installments against a total
[DTO] ResolvedTermsDto: id, total, installment(s)
