[DTO] CreateChangeOrderForInvoiceDto: id, description, deltaAmountCents
    input to create a change order against an invoice
[DTO] ChangeOrderDto: id, userId, invoiceId, contractId?, customerId?, description, deltaAmountCents, originalAmountCents?, status, createdAt, updatedAt, decidedAt?
    a persisted change-order record
[DTO] ChangeOrderListDto: changeOrder(s)
    a list of change orders for an invoice
[DTO] OwnerDto: userId
    the owning user id wrapper
[DTO] GetByIdDto: id
    an id lookup wrapper
[DTO] OkDto: ok
    a success body for deletes
[DTO] InvoiceRefDto: userId, invoiceId
    an invoice reference scoped to its owner
[DTO] InvoiceBalanceDto: invoiceId, amount, paidTotal, balance, status
    a computed invoice balance rollup
[DTO] ConfirmPaymentResultDto: ok, reason?, paymentId?
    result of confirming a claimed payment
[DTO] RejectClaimResultDto: ok, reason?
    result of rejecting a payment claim
[DTO] ForecastEntryDto: expectedLandDate, amount, label, invoiceId, source
    one forecast line entry
[DTO] ForecastResultDto: thisWeekCents, nextWeekCents, atRiskCents, asOf, entry(s)
    the receivables forecast result
[DTO] ExportCsvDto: year?
    input selecting the export year
[DTO] CsvDto: csv
    a CSV document payload
[DTO] VoiceRecordDto: transcript
    a voice transcript for payment recording
[DTO] PhotoRecordDto: amount?, payerHint?, method?, reference?
    OCR fields from a check photo
[DTO] ParsedUtteranceDto: amount?, payerHint?, method?, reference?
    fields parsed from an utterance
[DTO] DisambiguationDto: invoiceId, label, amount, customerName?
    one ambiguous payment-match candidate
[DTO] UtteranceResultDto: matchedInvoiceId?, paymentId?, parsed, disambiguation(s)
    result of recording a payment from an utterance
[DTO] InvoiceReminderDto: invoiceId, day
    input to fire one cadence reminder
[DTO] ReminderResultDto: invoiceId, day, channel(s), escalated
    result of one reminder fire
[DTO] ReminderSweepDto: ok, count, result(s)
