[DTO] NudgeResultDto: invoiceId, scheduledFor
    result of one scheduled-invoice nudge
[DTO] NudgeSweepDto: ok, count, nudge(s)
    result of a full nudge sweep
[DTO] EmailDispatchDto: id, to?, from?
